<title>MEXICO: Three Mexican ports closed due to bad weather.</title>
<headline>Three Mexican ports closed due to bad weather.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three ports on the Gulf of Mexico were closed on Sunday due to high winds, the Ministry of Transport and Communications said in a statement.</p>
<p>A cold front forced officials to close the ports of Veracruz, Coatzacoalcos, and Frontera.</p>
<p>The statement said the ports could be reopened late on Sunday.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
